From: Cennac <cennac@163.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:20:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: enable AGIBOT RK3588 media engines

Real AVC and HEVC playback selects Rockchip MPP but fails because the AGIBOT
board DTS leaves all decoder, encoder and RGA nodes disabled. Enable the full
media group used by the RK3588 EVB, including each required MMU and service.

---
 .../dts/rockchip/rk3588-agibot-mb0002-v2.dts | 148 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 148 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-agibot-mb0002-v2.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-agibot-mb0002-v2.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-agibot-mb0002-v2.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-agibot-mb0002-v2.dts
@@ -213,6 +213,154 @@
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&av1d {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&av1d_mmu {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&avsd {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&iep {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&iep_mmu {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&jpegd {
